DISCLAIMER

This dataset is a curated, best-effort reading of published reporting. It is
NOT an official, government or law-enforcement source, and it is not derived
from privileged data.

It carries no warranty of any kind. It is not a guarantee of anyone's safety.
The absence of a road from this register means nothing about that road, and the
presence of one is a statement about documented risk to drivers on a stretch of
public road — never a statement about the people who live near it.

Do not present this data as authoritative, and do not use it to make decisions
about individuals, insurance, credit, property, or access to services.
